 {"clause_id": "c054", "issues": [
   {"issue": "\"Just cause\" is the operative trigger for termination without any payment, and the clause lets the University terminate \"at any time\" on that ground; whether particular conduct meets it is the classic construction question. The provision itself supplies no standard, deferring to the definition that follows and to the term's \"normally understood meaning.\"", "type": 1, "prob": 0.50},
